  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Pendyala Chandrasekhar vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 16 November, 2022 Author: R. Raghunandan Rao Bench: R. Raghunandan Rao Hon'Ble Sri Justice R. Raghunandan Rao Criminal Petition No.9050 of 2022 Order:",
    "facts": "The petitioners are arrayed as accused Nos. 1 & 2 in C.C.No.40 of 2019 on the file of the Additional Junior Civil Judge, Repalle, Bapatla District, for offences under Sections 188, 120-b, 273 & 420 r/w. 34 of Indian Penal Code and Section 59 (i) & 63 of Food Safety Standards Act, 2006 on the ground that the petitioners were caught by storing tobacco and tobacco products. 2. The cases are being booked against persons, who are found to be either storing or transporting tobacco or tobacco products in the State of Andhra Pradesh. Persons, who are facing such cases, have been approaching this Court for relief.",
